L79D8:  LDA #$08
L79DA:  LDY #$AF
L79DC:  STA POKEY
L79DF:  STY $2C01

COINC_16:
L79E2:  PLA
L79E3:  TAX
L79E4:  PLA
L79E5:  TAY
L79E6:  PLA

COINC_1:
L79E7:  RTI

